@startuml Chatly_Sequence_Simple_View_Feed
title View Feed

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Authenticated User" as User
boundary "Web or Mobile Client" as Client
control "FeedController" as FeedController
control "FeedService" as FeedService
control "PostRepository" as PostRepo
control "ContactRepository" as ContactRepo
control "GlobalExceptionHandler" as ExceptionHandler

User -> Client: Open home feed
Client -> FeedController: getHomeFeed{cursor?, size}
FeedController -> FeedService: getHomeFeed(userId, cursor, size)

FeedService -> ContactRepo: resolve blocked or following
ContactRepo --> FeedService: filters
FeedService -> PostRepo: load posts for feed
PostRepo --> FeedService: posts + nextCursor
FeedService --> FeedController: FeedResponse{items, nextCursor}
FeedController --> Client: HTTP 200\nApiResponse{code:1000, result}

Client --> User: Render feed

@enduml
